sequenceDiagram
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant O as Order API
  participant C as Catalog API
  participant P as Promotion API
  participant S as Shipping API
  participant Pay as Payment API
  FE->>G: POST /api/orders/preview
  G->>O: Forward with JWT
  O->>C: Check product price/availability
  O->>P: POST /vouchers/validate
  O->>S: POST /shipping/calculate-fee
  O-->>FE: subtotal, discount, shippingFee, total
  FE->>G: POST /api/orders
  G->>O: Create order
  O->>Pay: Create bank transfer / COD payment
  O-->>FE: orderCode + status + payment data
